In this chapter, we will be using data from Nate Silver’s statistical analysis website—fivethirtyeight (Kim et al., 2018). The fivethirtyeight package includes 128 callable datasets. For a full list of datasets, follow this link: <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/fivethirtyeight/vignettes/fivethirtyeight.html>. To see all datasets that are available to you as callable objects, run the function data()
